# No secrets are required to build this site.
#
# BASE_PATH is only needed when deploying under a sub-path
# (e.g. GitHub Pages project site). CI sets this automatically.
# BASE_PATH=/AI_Forum_Website_v3
#
# Contact and training forms are delivered by EmailJS. The defaults in
# src/lib/config.ts point at the AI Forum account and work as-is; these
# values are public-by-design (they identify the account for browser
# requests and grant no account access). Set them here only to send
# through a different EmailJS account. Lock the account to your domains
# under Account -> Security -> Allowed origins. See CONTENT-TODO.md.
# VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=service_xxxxxxx
# VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=template_xxxxxxx
# VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
